Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:09:30 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 228/230] Profile polish: club slots, grouped settings, invite
 card, FA release notes

- Env badge is dev-only (import.meta.env.DEV), no account chip; telegram-linked
  caption with a green dot replaces the duplicate telegram-in row.
- My clubs: 5 circular slots (main club starred) opening the onboarding picker.
- Settings are one grouped rounded list with dividers; My leagues opens the
  existing LeaguePickerSheet; About card folds into a version line.
- Invite friends is a single card with one copy-invite-link button; the
  copy/redeem/share controls from the old code card are gone.
- Release notes carry Persian copies (linesFa) so the FA profile has no English
  strings. Dead referral strings removed from both locales.
